<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  7.65%			 O/N = 7.65%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  9.35%			 T/N = 7.65%</p>
<p>		   Nov 14, 1996			Nov 13, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  6.80%	1 month forward =  5.09%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  7.31%	2 month forward =  5.78%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  7.59%	3 month forward =  6.46%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  7.99%	4 month forward =  7.05%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  8.23%	5 month forward =  7.34%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  8.05%	6 month forward =  7.32%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
